  "title": "fig-enable-logic",
  "description": "EN_ISO and EN_B derived on the island from EN1 to EN3: a diode-OR of the three enables charges an RC node through a small resistor and discharges it through a large one, and the UCC27525 input thresholds turn each node into a delayed edge: EN_ISO through the non-inverting channel to Qi, EN_B through the inverting channel to Qb."
 },
